    },
    {
      "speaker": "scammer",
      "speaker_name": "诈骗者",
      "text": "你涉嫌洗钱，必须立即配合资金核查。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_001_line_000_scammer_d107c12e4c71.mp3",
      "start": 4.422,
      "end": 8.07,
      "scene_id": "02_accusation"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "text": "她明知号码异常，却被对方的强硬语气吓住。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_002_line_000_narrator_907b4413f5de.mp3",
      "start": 8.22,
      "end": 12.66,
      "scene_id": "03_foreign_number"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "scammer",
      "speaker_name": "诈骗者",
      "text": "不许挂断，不许告诉任何人，否则马上逮捕你。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_003_line_000_scammer_c5e02f85b222.mp3",
      "start": 12.81,
      "end": 16.986,
      "scene_id": "04_pacing"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "text": "李婷打开银行应用，手指停在确认转账上。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_004_line_000_narrator_a95541ee68d3.mp3",
      "start": 17.136,
      "end": 21.672,
      "scene_id": "05_transfer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "text": "就在这时，真正的反诈民警打来电话。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_005_line_000_narrator_803ec59748a1.mp3",
      "start": 21.822,
      "end": 25.71,
      "scene_id": "06_police_call"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "officer",
      "speaker_name": "陈警官",
      "text": "我是派出所民警。你正在遭遇诈骗，立刻挂断，绝对不要转账！",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_006_line_000_officer_96dae398d7ee.mp3",
      "start": 25.86,
      "end": 32.46,
      "scene_id": "07_real_officer"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "speaker_name": "旁白",
      "text": "李婷及时醒悟。记住：真警察不会通过电话办案，更不会让你转账。",
      "audio_path": "data\\qa\\anti_fraud_police_chibi_v1\\old\\final\\anti_fraud_police_old_raw.story\\audio\\scene_007_line_000_narrator_c87cd9f898cb.mp3",
